xcept those cities marked with an asterisk (＊), which are based on annual results.",title:"Points to remember when viewing the data",asterisk:"*",survey:"These data are based on the results of a questionnaire survey on land and building transactions in the target areas. Since each plot of land and building have unique characteristics (location, condition of the frontage road, area, use, etc.), the transactions conducted in each compilation period differ in nature because they reflect the unique characteristics of the land and buildings. Moreover, since the actual transaction price also reflect the circumstances of the persons involved (rushed sale, rushed purchase, etc.), they may vary from the price expected in normal transactions. For these reasons, the results posted on this website should not be considered to represent the overall transaction trends or the overall levels of land prices, etc. in the target areas during these compilation periods.",data:"In the future, more samples may be added to the data for each quarter. Please note that the number of samples in the last quarter, in particular, may significantly change in the next quarter or later."},chart:{title:{base:"Basic statistics for the ",tokyoJoint:" of "},no:"No.",timeOfTransaction:"Transaction period",numberOfSamples:"No. of Samples",landUnit:"Unit Land Price (yen/㎡)",averageValue:"Average",standardDeviation:"Standard Deviation",minimumValue:"Minimum",firstQuartile:"Lower Quartile",median:"Median",thirdQuartile:"Upper Quartile",maximumValue:"Maximum",priceUnit:"Value(yen/㎡)",legend:{cross:"×",rect:"■",circle:"●",triangle:"▲"},yen:"yen"},reins:{reference:"(Reference)",link:"REINS market information",explain:"・・・Graphs are available of transaction price information compiled by the designated distribution system in accordance with the Building Lots and Buildings Transaction Business Act. "},searchProcedure:{title:"[Search procedure]",region:"①Select regional division",kind:"②Select type",area:"③Select area"},searchCondition:{region:"Regional division",kind:"Type"}},manual:{title:"Webの利用方法（不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報）",abstract:"「不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報」のヘルプでは、概要、操作説明を通して、システムの利用方法を説明します。",subtitle:"目次",links:{link1:"1. 不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面",link1_1:"1. 1. 検索条件設定エリア",link1_2:"1. 2. 検索結果一覧表示エリア",link2:"2. 土地取引価格の概況画面",link2_1:"2. 1. 検索条件設定エリア",link2_2:"2. 2. 基本統計量表示エリア",link3:"3. 不動産取引価格情報詳細画面",link4:"4. 土地取引件数推移グラフ画面",link5:"5. 散布図（前面道路）画面",link6:"6. 散布図（最寄駅）画面"},points:"　・・・　",abstracts:{abstract1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面の見方や主要な機能、操作方法を説明します。",abstract1_1:"検索条件設定エリアの機能と操作方法を説明します。",abstract1_2:"検索結果一覧表示エリアの見方と機能を説明します。",abstract2:"土地取引価格の概況画面の見方や機能、操作方法を説明します。",abstract2_1:"検索条件設定エリアの機能と操作方法を説明します。",abstract2_2:"基本統計量表示エリアの見方と機能を説明します。",abstract3:"不動産取引価格情報詳細画面の見方や機能、操作方法を説明します。",abstract4:"土地取引件数推移グラフ画面の見方や機能、操作方法を説明します。",abstract5:"散布図（前面道路）画面の見方や機能、操作方法を説明します。",abstract6:"散布図（最寄駅）画面の見方や機能、操作方法を説明します。"},details:{detail1:{heading:"1. 不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面",contents1:"　不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面では、不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索条件を指定し、検索を実行することで検索結果を一覧で表示することができます。また、指定した条件により、不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報のCSVファイルをダウンロードすることができます。",contents2:"　不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面は以下の画面から表示することができます。",howToDownload:"トップ画面＞「不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード」ボタンをクリック",contents3:"　不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面の各エリアの操作方法は以下の通りです。"},detail1_1:{heading:"1. 1. 検索条件設定エリア",contents1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面にアクセスすると、以下の検索条件設定エリアが表示されます。",diagram1_1:" 図表 1-1「検索条件設定エリア」",diagram1_2:{title:"図表 1-2「検索条件設定エリアにおける機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"地域選択",explanation1:"検索する対象地域を指定します。",explanation2:"「住所からの場合」を選択した場合、都道府県・市区町村・地区をプルダウンメニューから指定することができます。都道府県が選択されていれば、市区町村・地区まで指定する必要はありません。",explanation3:"「路線・駅名からの場合」を選択した場合、地方・路線・駅を指定することができます。駅については補助入力検索が可能です。検索結果を表示するためには駅名まで指定する必要があります。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"価格情報区分選択",explanation1:"検索する価格情報を「不動産取引価格情報」または「成約価格情報」から指定します。両方を指定することもできます。"},description3:{number:"③",item:"種類選択",explanation1:"検索する土地の種類をプルダウンメニューで指定します。",explanation2:"「土地・土地と建物・宅地・中古マンション等・農地・林地・すべて」から指定することができます。",explanation3:"※成約価格情報は【土地と建物】・【中古マンション等】のみ検索可能です。",explanation4:"※成約価格情報の場合、「土地と建物」とは「戸建て」を指します。"},description4:{number:"④",item:"時期選択",explanation1:"検索する取引時期を指定します。",explanation2:"※地図画面で表示可能な期間は直近5年分となります。"},description5:{number:"⑤",item:"現在の条件での検索結果",explanation1:"①～④で指定した条件に該当する価格情報の件数を表示します。"},description6:{number:"⑥",item:"一覧表示ボタン",explanation1:"指定した条件で一覧表示ボタンをクリックすると、「1.2. 検索結果一覧表示エリア」に検索結果が表示されます。"},description7:{number:"⑦",item:"関連画面の表示リンク",explanation1:"「マニュアル」リンクをクリックすると、Webの利用方法（不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報検索）画面、「制度と用語」リンクをクリックすると、不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の制度や用語の説明画面が表示されます。"},description8:{number:"⑧",item:"ダウンロードボタン",explanation1:"ダウンロードボタンをクリックすると、指定した条件の不動産取引価格情報のCSVファイルをダウンロードすることができます。"}}},detail1_2:{heading:"1. 2. 検索結果一覧表示エリア",contents1:"1.1. 検索条件設定エリアで指定した条件での検索結果が表示されます。",pc:"・PC版",sp:"・SP版",diagram1_3:"図表 1-3「検索結果一覧表示エリア（PC版）」",diagram1_4:"図表 1-4「検索結果一覧表示エリア（SP版）」",diagram1_5:{title:"図表 1-5「検索結果一覧表示エリアにおける機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"土地取引件数表示",explanation1:"検索条件で指定した「地域」と「時期」から、該当する土地取引件数を表示します。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"検索条件表示エリア",explanation1:"検索対象の「地域」、「価格情報区分」、「種類」、「時期」および該当件数を表示します。"},description3:{number:"③",item:"各画面へのボタン",explanation1:"「取引件数の推移を表示」ボタンをクリックすると、土地取引件数推移グラフ画面が表示され、検索対象地域の土地取引件数の推移グラフが表示されます。",explanation2:"「該当の地図画面を表示」ボタンをクリックすると地図画面が表示され、検索対象地域の中心がフォーカスされます。",explanation3:"「土地取引価格の概況画面を表示」ボタンをクリックすると、土地取引価格の概況画面が表示され、検索対象地域の土地取引価格に関する基本統計量（土地面積あたり単価の平均値など）が一覧表形式とグラフ形式で表示されます。"},description4:{number:"④",item:"並び順・絞り込みの解除（PC版のみ）",explanation1:"⑧で指定した並び順と絞り込みを解除します。"},description5:{number:"⑤",item:"検索結果一覧表",explanation1:"指定した条件の不動産取引価格情報が一覧表形式で表示されます。",explanation2:"「所在地」のデータをクリックすると、該当する所在地での表示データの絞り込みができます。",explanation3:"「最寄駅」リンクをクリックすると、散布図（最寄駅）画面が表示され、土地のm2単価と最寄駅までの距離の関係が散布図で表示されます。",explanation4:"「最寄駅 名称」のデータをクリックすると、該当する駅名での表示データの絞り込みができます。",explanation5:"「前面道路」リンクをクリックすると、散布図（前面道路）画面が表示され、土地のm2単価と前面道路の幅員の関係が散布図で表示されます。",explanation6:"「詳細表示」のボタンをクリックすると、該当する不動産取引価格情報詳細画面が表示されます。"},description6:{number:"⑥",item:"ツールチップ",explanation1:"？アイコンをクリックすることで、該当する用語の詳細説明を表示することができます。"},description7:{number:"⑦",item:"ページャ",explanation1:"検索結果が多い場合は、複数ページに分割して表示します。",explanation2:"「ページ番号」ボタンをクリックすると、対象のページを表示します。",explanation3:"ボタンをクリックすると次のページを表示し、",explanation4:"ボタンをクリックすると最後のページを表示します。",explanation5:"ボタンをクリックすると前のページを表示し、",explanation6:"ボタンをクリックすると1ページ目を表示します。"},description8:{number:"⑧",item:"並び順・絞り込み指定エリア（PC版のみ）",explanation1:"データの並び順を「昇順」または「降順」で指定することができます。",explanation2:"データの絞り込みには以下の4パターンがあります。データ項目によって絞り込み方法は異なります。",pattern1:"空白の有無",pattern2:"文字の自由入力",pattern3:"数値の範囲指定",pattern4:"チェックボックス形式"}}},detail2:{heading:"2. 土地取引価格の概況画面",contents1:"　土地取引価格の概況画面では、表示する地域と種別（住宅地、商業地）を選択し、過去5年分の土地取引価格の基本統計量（土地面積あたり単価の平均値など）を表示することができます。",contents2:"　土地取引価格の概況画面は以下の画面から表示することができます。",howToTransitionRealEstatePrices1:"トップ画面＞「主要都市における土地取引価格の概況」ボタンをクリック",howToTransitionRealEstatePrices2:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面＞一覧表示後に「土地取引価格の概況画面を表示」ボタンをクリック",contents3:"　土地取引価格の概況画面の各エリアの操作方法や見方は以下の通りです。"},detail2_1:{heading:"2. 1. 検索条件設定エリア",contents:"　土地取引価格の概況画面にアクセスすると、以下の検索条件設定エリアが表示されます。",diagram1_1:"図表 2-1「検索条件設定エリア（土地取引価格の概況）」",diagram2_1:{title:"図表 2-2「検索条件設定エリア（土地取引価格の概況）における機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"地方区分選択",explanation1:"検索したい対象地方区分を指定します。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"種類選択",explanation1:"土地取引価格の種類を「住宅地」または「商業地」から指定します。"},description3:{number:"③",item:"地域選択",explanation1:"①地方区分で選択した地方の中から検索対象の都道府県と市区町村を指定します。",explanation2:"市区町村のリンクをクリックすると、その地域に該当する土地取引価格の基本統計量が検索条件設定エリアの下に表示されます。"}}},detail2_2:{heading:"2. 2. 基本統計量表示エリア",contents1:"　2.1. 検索条件設定エリアで指定した条件での検索結果が表示されます。",contents2:"　①基本統計量の一覧表エリア及び②基本統計量のグラフエリアで表示される項目の詳細は以下の通りです。",diagram2_1:" 図表 2-3「基本統計量表示エリア」",diagram2_2:{title:"図表 2-4「基本統計量表示エリアにおける機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"基本統計量の一覧表示エリア",explanation1:"取引時点と標本数および土地単価の基本統計量が一覧表形式で表示されます。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"基本統計量のグラフエリア",explanation1:"取引時点と土地単価の基本統計量がクラフ形式で表示されます。グラフ上の要素にマウスを当てることで、該当する取引時点の基本統計量の詳細な値を確認することができます。"}},diagram2_3:{title:"図表 2-5「基本統計量の一覧表エリア及び基本統計量のグラフエリアで表示される項目」",tableheader1:"項目",tableheader2:"説明",description1:{item:"No",explanation1:"取引時点の古いものから順に付与されます。"},description2:{item:"取引時点",explanation1:"不動産の取引時点が表示されます。",explanation2:"例)四半期単位：「平成20年第1四半期」",explanation3:"年単位：「平成20年」"},description3:{item:"標本数",explanation1:"選択した地域・土地の種類について、各集計単位（四半期又は年）の不動産取引価格情報のデータ数が表示されます。"},description4:{item:"土地単価(円/㎡)",explanation1:"選択した地域・土地の種類について、各集計単位（四半期又は年）の土地単価(円/㎡)の平均値、標準偏差、最小値、第1四分位数、中央値、第3四分位数、最大値を表示します。",explanation2:"※標本数が0件の場合は、各項目に「-」が表示され、標本数が10件未満の場合は、各項目が括弧で囲まれた状態で表示されます。",landUnitTable:{tableheader1:"分類",tableheader2:"説明",description1:{classification:"平均値",explanation1:"全てのデータの平均の値。"},description2:{classification:"標準偏差",explanation1:"全てのデータの標準偏差の値。"},description3:{classification:"最小値",explanation1:"データを小さい順に並べたときの一番小さい値。"},description4:{classification:"第1四分位数",explanation1:"データを小さい順に並べたときの小さい方から25％目の値。"},description5:{classification:"中央値",explanation1:"データを小さい順に並べたときの中位の値。"},description6:{classification:"第3四分位数",explanation1:"データを小さい順に並べたときの小さい方から75%目の値。"},description7:{classification:"最大値",explanation1:"データを小さい順に並べたときの一番大きい値。"}}}}},detail3:{heading:"3. 不動産取引価格情報詳細画面",diagram3_1:"図表3-1 「不動産取引価格情報詳細画面」",contents1:"　不動産取引価格情報詳細画面では、不動産取引価格情報の詳細情報を個別に表示します。不動産取引価格情報に加えて、成約価格情報も表示対象とします。",contents2:"　不動産取引価格情報詳細画面は以下の画面から表示することができます。",howToTransitionRealEstatePricesDetail1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面＞「詳細表示」欄の「表示」ボタンをクリック",howToTransitionRealEstatePricesDetail2:"散布図（前面道路）画面＞散布図上のポイントをクリック",howToTransitionRealEstatePricesDetail3:"散布図（最寄駅）画面＞散布図上のポイントをクリック",contents3:"　不動産取引価格情報詳細画面の各要素やエリアの操作方法や見方は以下の通りです。",diagram3_2:{title:"図表3-2 「不動産取引価格情報詳細画面における機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"詳細表示エリア",explanation1:"該当する不動産取引価格情報または成約価格情報の詳細情報を個別に表示します。",explanation2:"土地の種類によって表中に表示される項目は変化します。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"ツールチップ",explanation1:"？アイコンをクリックすることで、該当する用語の詳細説明を表示することができます。"},description3:{number:"③",item:"「周辺の地価公示」リンク",explanation1:"リンクをクリックすると、国土交通省地価公示一覧画面が表示されます。",explanation2:"該当する周辺の地価公示が存在しない場合、リンクは表示されません。"},description4:{number:"④",item:"「周辺の地価調査」リンク",explanation1:"リンクをクリックすると、都道府県地価調査一覧画面が表示されます。",explanation2:"該当する周辺の地価調査が存在しない場合、リンクは表示されません。"},description5:{number:"⑤",item:"「× 閉じる」ボタン",explanation1:"ボタンをクリックすると、不動産取引価格情報詳細画面を表示しているタブを閉じることができます。"}}},detail4:{heading:"4. 土地取引件数推移グラフ画面",diagram4_1:"図表4-1 「土地取引件数推移グラフ画面」",contents1:"　土地取引件数推移グラフ画面では、土地取引件数の推移グラフを選択条件（地域）に合わせて表示します。このグラフは、不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面の地域選択において「住所からの場合」を選択した場合のみ、不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面から表示することができます。",howToTransitionGraph1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面＞一覧表示後に「取引件数の推移を表示」ボタンをクリック",contents2:"　土地取引件数推移グラフ画面の各要素やエリアの操作方法や見方は以下の通りです。",diagram4_2:{title:"図表 4-2 「土地取引件数推移グラフ画面における機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"推移グラフ表示エリア",explanation1:"取引件数を縦軸、取引時期を横軸にとった折れ線グラフで土地取引件数の推移を表示します。",explanation2:"グラフ上にマウスを当てると、特定の四半期の詳細な土地取引件数を確認することができます。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"「× 閉じる」ボタン",explanation1:"ボタンをクリックすると、土地取引件数推移グラフ画面を表示しているタブを閉じることができます。"}}},detail5:{heading:"5. 散布図（前面道路）画面",diagram5_1:"図表5-1 「散布図（前面道路）画面」",contents1:"　散布図（前面道路）画面では、該当する土地の m²単価と前面道路の幅員の関係が散布図で表示されます。",contents2:"　散布図（前面道路）画面は以下の画面から表示することができます。ただし、不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面の地域選択で「住所からの場合」を指定し、都道府県のみを指定した場合、散布図（前面道路）画面へのリンク機能は無効となるため、表示することができません。",howToTransitionFrontStreets1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面＞一覧表の「前面道路」リンクをクリック",contents3:"　散布図（前面道路）画面の各要素やエリアの操作方法や見方は以下の通りです。",diagram5_2:{title:"図表5-2 「散布図（前面道路）画面における機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"検索条件表示エリア",explanation1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面において指定した検索条件（種類・地域・取引時期・価格情報区分）と検索結果件数を表示します。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"散布図表示エリア",explanation1:"土地の㎡単価を縦軸、前面道路の幅員を横軸にとった散布図を表示します。",explanation2:"散布図上のポイントをクリックすると、該当する地点の不動産取引価格情報詳細画面が表示されます。"},description3:{number:"③",item:"「× 閉じる」ボタン",explanation1:"ボタンをクリックすると、散布図（前面道路）画面を表示しているタブを閉じることができます。"}}},detail6:{heading:"6. 散布図（最寄駅）画面",diagram6_1:"図表6-1 「散布図（最寄駅）画面」",contents1:"　散布図（最寄駅）画面では、該当する土地のm²単価と最寄駅までの距離の関係が散布図で表示されます。",contents2:"　散布図（最寄駅）画面は以下の画面から表示することができます。",howToTransitionNearestStation1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面＞一覧表の「最寄駅」リンクをクリック",contents3:"　不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面の地域選択で「住所からの場合」を指定した場合は、一覧表の「最寄駅 名称」のデータをクリックした後に「最寄駅」リンクをクリックすることで、該当する駅についての散布図（最寄駅）画面を表示することができるようになります。",contents4:"　散布図（最寄駅）画面の各要素やエリアの操作方法や見方は以下の通りです。",diagram6_2:{title:"図表6-2 「散布図（最寄駅）画面における機能一覧」",tableheader1:"番号",tableheader2:"項目",tableheader3:"機能説明",description1:{number:"①",item:"検索条件表示エリア",explanation1:"不動産価格（取引価格・成約価格）情報の検索・ダウンロード画面において指定した検索条件（種類・地域・取引時期・価格情報区分）と検索結果件数を表示します。"},description2:{number:"②",item:"散布図表示エリア",explanation1:"土地の m²単価を縦軸、最寄駅までの距離を横軸にとった散布図を表示します。",explanation2:"散布図上のポイントをクリックすると、該当する地点の不動産取引価格情報詳細画面が表示されます。"},description3:{number:"③",item:"「× 閉じる」ボタン",explanation1:"ボタンをクリックすると、散布図（最寄駅）画面を表示しているタブを閉じることができます。"}}}},close:"閉じる"},about:{title:"Explanation about the Real Estate Price (Transaction Price/Contract Price) Information System and related terms",explanatoryNote:" The following includes the description of the terms used on this website. Please be advised that since the purpose of the following is to explain the terms to facilitate the understanding of users of this website, they may differ from the general description of these terms.",table:{subtitle1:{subtitle:"　　Real Estate Transaction-price Information System",marker1:"The real estate transaction-price information is publicized by Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism (MLIT) to promote the reliability and transparency of the real estate market and facilitate and activate the real estate transactions. To this end, MLIT conducts a questionnaire survey of persons involved in real estate transactions and publicizes the results after processing them to make them unidentifiable.",marker2:"MLIT compiles the data every three months and publicizes them quarterly. It is planned to publicize the data for the 3rd quarter (From July to September) 2026 in January 2027.",marker3:{fragment1:"Click ",fragment2:"here",fragment3:" to show descriptions of each item."},marker4:{fragment1:"Click ",fragment2:"here",fragment3:" to show descriptions of Land General Information API."},caution:{title:"<Notes>",caution1:"The real estate transaction-price information is based on the results of a questionnaire survey of persons involved in real estate transactions. For figures, no numerical adjustments have been made except rounding. When viewing and using the data, care must be taken as real estate transaction prices are subject to change not only to individual factors, such as the area, shape, and the conditions of frontage road of each property, but also to transactional factors that may lead to different prices for the same land.",caution2:"The number of transaction price samples in each quarter may change in the future. Please note that the number of samples in the last quarter, in particular, may significantly change in the next quarter or later.",caution3:{fragment1:"The questionnaire survey on real estate transactions is conducted based on the registration data on the transfer of ownership of land and condominiums. The following transactions, however, are not included in the survey:",land:"　<Land>",item1:"Transactions in areas other than ",area:"the survey target areas",fragment2:" and the transactions for land whose area is less than the designated survey target area (30 ㎡ or 60 ㎡ for residential land; 100 ㎡ for forest land, agricultural land, and other).",fragment3:"Transactions where part of the ownership is transferred and registered: Transactions for co-owned private road sites and transactions for condominium sites, etc. whose registration for the preservation of ownership was made before 1983 (when the Act on Unit Ownership, etc., of Building was revised).",fragment4:"Transactions involving a set of different land categories (except “residential land + other” and “rice field + field”)",fragment5:"Transactions conducted more than one year ago, etc.",buildingUnitOwnership:"　<Condominiums>",item2:"Transactions in areas other than ",fragment6:" (cities other than three major metropolitan areas* with a population of less than 100,000, etc.) and transactions for land whose area is less than the designated survey target area (10 ㎡).",fragment7:"Package transactions for more than one condominium",fragment8:"unit Transactions for condominium units where the right of site is not ownership (lease, etc.)",fragment9:"Transactions for condominium units whose registration for the preservation of ownership was made before 1983 (when the Act on Unit Ownership, etc., of Building was revised) (condominium units where the right of site was not registered)",fragment10:"Transactions where part of the ownership is transferred and registered, such as resort club membership transactions",descriptionTerm:"* Three major metropolitan areas",definitionDescription:"Tokyo area (Tokyo, Kanagawa, Saitama, Chiba, Ibaraki), Nagoya area (Aichi, Mie), and Osaka area (Osaka, Hyogo, Kyoto, Nara)",surveyArea:"Target Areas of Real Estate Transaction Questionnaire Survey",descriptionTerm1:"Regions where data provision starts from the 3rd quarter of 2005",definitionDescription1:"Regions centering on the 23 wards of Tokyo, Saitama, Yokohama, Kawasaki, Nagoya, Gifu, Kyoto, and Osaka.",descriptionTerm2:"Regions where the data provision starts from the 2nd quarter of 2006",definitionDescription2:"Regions centering on government ordinance cities in addition to the above.",descriptionTerm3:"Regions where the data provision starts from the 2nd quarter of 2007",definitionDescription3:"Land price publication target regions including prefectural capitals, etc. (except Hokkaido, where target regions include only Sapporo, Asahikawa, and Hakodate).",descriptionTerm4:"Regions where the data provision starts from the 2nd quarter of 2008",definitionDescription4:"Land price publication target regions including prefectural capitals, etc. (almost all parts of the country)."}}},subtitle2:{subtitle:"　　Contract price information",contents:{content1:{item1:"Real estate transaction price information stored in the computer network system (REINS) operated by the real estate distribution organizations designated by MLIT that is made available to the public by MLIT via REINS Market Information (RMI), a real estate transaction information service for consumers, after being processed so as to make individual transactions unidentifiable.",item2:"MLIT compiles the data every three months and publicizes them quarterly. It is planned to publicize the data for the 3rd quarter (From July to September) 2026 in January 2027.",item3:"Click ",link1:"here",item4:" to show descriptions of each item.",item5:"Click ",link2:"here",item6:" to learn more about the API for contract price information."},content2:{item1:"<Notes>",item2:"This information may not be provided on an item-by-item basis because it may not be appropriate as market information when detects abnormal values. No numerical adjustments, except for rounding, have been made to price figures. The transaction price of real estate varies depending on individual factors such as area and the condition of the frontage road, and can even vary for the same piece of real estate depending on the circumstances of the transaction. Please keep these points in mind when viewing this information."}}},subtitle3:{subtitle:"　　Land Price Public Notices and Prefectural Land Price Survey Information",fragment1:"Locations with land price public notice and/or prefectural land price survey information are indicated with symbols on the map when it is displayed on the scale of “oaza”, “chome”, or “details”. Click the symbol to view the details.",fragment2:'By clicking the "Select year" button to select the survey year, you can display the data for land price public notices (2003 to latest year) and prefectural land price surveys (2003 to latest year) on the map.',fragment3:"Click ",link:"here",fragment4:" for more information about land price public notices and prefectural land price surveys."},subtitle4:{subtitle:"　　Number of Transactions",fragment1:"The number of transactions is obtained by converting the registration data related to real estate transactions into transaction units and then compiling them by region and by quarterly (three months) at MLIT.",fragment2:"The number of transactions will not be displayed when searched via “Search by Line and Station.”",caution:{title:"<Notes>",caution1:{fragment1:"The number of land transactions is the total number of transactions for all types of land, including ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",link3:"agricultural land",fragment22:", and ",link4:"forest land",fragment3:". The information is compiled by MLIT, which first converts the registration data of ownership transfers arising from transactions into transaction units and then compiles them by region and by transaction period (every three months).",fragment4:"The number of transactions for condominiums, etc. is the number of transactions for condominium units. The information is compiled by MLIT, which first converts the registration data on the transfer of ownership arising from transactions or the registration data for the preservation of ownership into transaction units and then compiles them by region and by transaction period (every three months). While the questionnaire survey targets only those cases involving the transfer of ownership (",link5:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment5:"), the number of condominium transactions includes cases that involve the registration of the preservation of ownership (transactions for newly built condominiums, etc.).",fragment6:"The search results obtained via “search for ALL conditions” show the total number of transactions including land transactions and condominium transactions, etc.."},caution2:{fragment1:"For a transaction unit, the number of land transactions generally corresponds to the number of registration applications. However, in cases where the same registration application includes properties whose location names (oaza and chome) are different, they are counted separately.",fragment2:"The transaction unit for the number of condominium transactions, etc. is a condominium unit (apartment). In cases of package transactions involving more than one unit (apartment), each unit is counted."},caution3:"The transaction period refers to the date of the sales contract, which is obtained via a survey of persons involved in the transaction. In cases where the date of the sales contract is unknown, the date of registration of the cause is adopted. The minimum data collection period is one quarter (three months). If you select the search period “OO quarter (including the past one year),” it will show the data for four quarters (one year) including the latest quarter. If you select the search period “OO quarter (including the past two years), it will show the data for eight quarters (two years) including the latest quarter.",caution4:{fragment1:"For data up to March 2007, the data only for the ",link:"target areas of the real estate questionnaire survey",fragment2:" will be displayed, and the data for areas other than the target areas are not displayed (“-”). Moreover, if prefectural data include city, town, ward, villages outside the target areas of the survey, the data for these city, town, ward, villages are not displayed (“-”).",fragment3:"The data up to March 2008 do not include the data of some regions where legal affairs bureaus have not yet been computerized. Therefore, in such regions, the number of transactions displayed may be less than the actual number of transactions."},caution5:"The transactions for real estate whose areas are less than the target areas for the real estate transaction questionnaire survey and the transactions where only part of the ownership is transferred, etc. are counted in the number of transactions.",caution6:"When there is a municipal merger, the subsequent data of merged city, town, ward, villages are incorporated into the data of a newly formed city, town, ward, villages.",caution7:"The compilation of these data does not constitute a statistical survey."}},subtitle5:{subtitle:"　　Other Land Information",fragment1:"For other land-related information and land policy related information, please visit the ",link:"website of MLIT homepage",fragment2:"."},categoryDescription:"<Description of Real Estate Transaction Price Information Items>",subtitle6:{subtitle:"　　Type",fragment:"Real Estate is divided into the following types: residential land, pre-owned condominiums, etc., agricultural land, and forest land. Residential land is further divided into two types of residential land (land only) and residential land (land and building).",note1:"Transactions for residential land (land only) indicate the transactions for land only.",note2:"Transactions for residential land (land and building) mean the package transactions for the land and buildings, etc..",note3:"Transactions for pre-owned condominiums, etc. are the transactions for condominium units (apartments, etc.)."},subtitle7:{subtitle:"　　Location",fragment:"For location, addresses are shown only up to cho (town) and oaza (smaller parts of a town) (e.g., Kasumigaseki, Chiyoda ward; Benten, Minato ward, Osaka, etc.). However, for cases where the property can be identified if the address is displayed up to cho and oaza, a wider geographical region than cho and oaza is used to designate the location."},subtitle8:{subtitle:"　　Area",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", the characteristics of surrounding areas are described as residential area, commercial area, industrial area, or potential residential area."},subtitle9:{subtitle:"　　Nearest Station",fragment1:"For the ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", and ",link3:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", the name of the nearest train station and the time distance (minute) from the location of the property to the nearest train station (for subway, to the ground entrance) are displayed.",fragment5:"A time distance less than 30 minutes is displayed in minutes. A time distance greater than 30 minutes is displayed in the following time periods: 30 minutes to 59 minutes, 1 hour to 1 hour 29 minutes, 1 hour 30 minutes to 1 hour 59 minutes, and 2 hours or more.",fragment6:"For cases where the nearest station is unknown, the entry field is left blank."},subtitle10:{subtitle:"　　Total Transaction Value",fragment1:"For each of the ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", ",link3:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", ",link4:"agricultural land",fragment5:", and ",link5:"forest land",fragment6:", the total transaction value (10,000 yen) is displayed (overhead costs, such as agent’s commission, not included).",fragment7:"Figures are rounded to two decimal places. Any numerical adjustments other than rounding are not made to the figures."},subtitle11:{subtitle:"　　Area (㎡)",fragment1:"For each of the ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", ",link3:"agricultural land",fragment4:", and ",link4:"forest land",fragment5:", the surveyed area (㎡) obtained from a survey of persons involved in transactions or the registered area (㎡) specified in a register if the surveyed area is unknown is provided.",fragment6:"For ",link5:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment7:", the floor area (㎡) of the exclusively owned area registered in a register (the area measured inside walls or other partitions) is provided.",fragment8:" For all land types, data for small properties with an area less than 10 ㎡ are not published.",fragment9:"For properties with an area of less than 200 ㎡, the area data are displayed in 5 ㎡ intervals, while for properties with an area of 200 ㎡ or greater, the data are displayed after rounding the figures to the first two digits from the left. For transactions for land with an area of 2,000 ㎡ or greater, the data are displayed as “2,000 ㎡ or greater.” (However, for transactions involving ",link6:"agricultural land",fragment10:" and ",link7:"forest land",fragment11:", those with an area of 5,000 ㎡ or greater are displayed as “5,000 ㎡ or greater.”)"},subtitle12:{subtitle:"　　Unit Land Price per tsubo",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", the unit price (10,000 yen) per tsubo is provided, which is obtained by dividing the ",link2:"total transaction",fragment3:" value of each plot of land by the land area (tsubo). ",fragment4:"Figures are rounded to two decimal places."},subtitle13:{subtitle:"　　Unit Land Price per ㎡",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", the unit price (10,000 yen) per ㎡ is provided, which is obtained by dividing the ",link2:"total transaction",fragment3:" value of each plot of land by the ",link3:"land area (㎡)",fragment4:". ",fragment5:"Figures are rounded to two decimal places."},subtitle14:{subtitle:"　　Frontage of Land (m)",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", the frontage/width of land (m) (the length of land in contact with a frontage road) is provided. ",fragment4:"In cases where the contact length is 50 m or longer, the frontage data are displayed as “50 m or longer.” ",fragment5:"In cases where the land frontage is unknown, the entry field is left blank. For this item, only the Details option is available."},subtitle15:{subtitle:"　　Land Shape",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", the general shape of land is provided as follows: square, almost square, rectangle, almost rectangle, trapezoid, almost trapezoid, irregular, almost regular, and lot, etc. without road access."},subtitle16:{subtitle:"　　Total Floor Area of Building (㎡)",fragment1:"For buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", the total floor area (㎡) is provided.",fragment3:"For cases where the floor area is less than 200 ㎡, the data are displayed in 5 ㎡ intervals, and for cases where the floor area is 200 ㎡ or greater, figures are rounded to two decimal places. For large transactions where the building floor area is 2,000 ㎡ or greater, the data are displayed as “2,000 ㎡ or greater” whereas for small transactions where the floor area is less than 10 ㎡, the data are displayed as “less than 10 ㎡.”"},subtitle17:{subtitle:"　　Construction Year of Building",fragment1:"For buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the construction year of each building is provided. ",fragment4:"For buildings built before 1945, the construction year data are displayed as “before the war.” In cases where the construction year is unknown, the entry field is left blank."},subtitle18:{subtitle:"　　Building Structure",fragment1:"For buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the structure of each building is provided using the following abbreviations:",fragment4:"In cases where the structure is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm1:"Steel frame reinforced concrete",definitionDescription1:"SRC",descriptionTerm2:"Reinforced concrete",definitionDescription2:"RC",descriptionTerm3:"Steel frame",definitionDescription3:"S",descriptionTerm4:"Light steel structure",definitionDescription4:"LS",descriptionTerm5:"Concrete block",definitionDescription5:"B",descriptionTerm6:"Wooden",definitionDescription6:"W"},subtitle19:{subtitle:"　　Room Layout of Exclusively Owned Area",fragment1:"For ",link1:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment2:", the room layout in the exclusively owned area is provided. In cases where the room layout is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm:"For example:",definitionDescription:"1K, 1DK, 2DK, 1LDK, 2LDK, 3LDK, 4LDK, Other"},subtitle20:{subtitle:"　　Use",fragment1:"For the buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:" and exclusively owned areas of ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the current usage is provided.",fragment4:"For multiple-use cases, all uses are listed. In cases where the use is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm:"For example:",definitionDescription:"House, office, shop, factory, warehouse, workshop, parking lot, and other (hotel, inn, educational facilities, religious facilities, hospital, etc.)"},subtitle21:{subtitle:"　　Purpose of Use",fragment1:"For each of the ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", ",link3:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", ",link4:"agricultural land",fragment5:", and ",link5:"forest land",fragment6:"forest land, the purpose of use is provided.",fragment7:"In cases where the purpose of use is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm:"For example:",definitionDescription:"House, shop, office, factory, warehouse, and other (educational facilities, cultural facilities, hospital, welfare facilities, parking lot, etc.)"},subtitle22:{subtitle:"　　Frontage Road",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", the width (m), type, and direction of the road in contact with the land are provided.",fragment4:"In cases where the frontage road is unknown, the field is left blank.",fragment5:"Road types are displayed as follows:",note1:"For roads specified by the Road Act: National road, Prefectural road, Municipal road, etc.",note2:"For roads within the land readjustment project area: District road",note3:"For privately managed roads that are commonly called private roads: Private road",note4:"Other roads: Road"},subtitle23:{subtitle:"　　City Planning",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", and ",link3:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", the use districts designated by the City Planning Act are represented by the following abbreviations:",fragment5:"In cases where the city plan is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm1:"Category I exclusively low-story residential zone",definitionDescription1:"1 Exc Low",descriptionTerm2:"Category II exclusively low-story residential zone",definitionDescription2:"2 Exc Low",descriptionTerm3:"Category I exclusively medium-high residential zone",definitionDescription3:"1 Exc Med",descriptionTerm4:"Category II exclusively medium-high residential zone",definitionDescription4:"2 Exc Med",descriptionTerm5:"Category I residential zone",definitionDescription5:"1 Res",descriptionTerm6:"Category II residential zone",definitionDescription6:"2 Res",descriptionTerm7:"Quasi-residential zone",definitionDescription7:"Quasi-Res",descriptionTerm8:"Rural Residential zone",definitionDescription8:"Rural Res",descriptionTerm9:"Neighborhood commercial zone",definitionDescription9:"Neighborhood Comm",descriptionTerm10:"Commercial zone",definitionDescription10:"Commercial",descriptionTerm11:"Quasi-industrial zone",definitionDescription11:"Quasi-Ind",descriptionTerm12:"Industrial zone",definitionDescription12:"Industrial",descriptionTerm13:"Exclusively industrial zone",definitionDescription13:"Exc Ind",descriptionTerm14:"Urbanization control area",definitionDescription14:"Control Area",descriptionTerm15:"Non-divided city planning area",definitionDescription15:"Non-Div",descriptionTerm16:"Quasi-city planning area",definitionDescription16:"Quasi Plan",descriptionTerm17:"Outside city planning area",definitionDescription17:"Out Plan"},subtitle24:{subtitle:"　　Maximums Building Coverage Ratio and Maximums Floor-area Ratio (%)",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", and ",link3:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", the designated Maximums building coverage ratio (%) and maximums floor-area ratio (%) are provided.",fragment5:"In cases where the maximums building coverage ratio and/or the Maximums floor-area ratio are unknown, the entry field for the unknown ratio is left blank."},subtitle25:{subtitle:"　　Transaction Period",fragment:"The transaction period means the date of contract, which is obtained via a questionnaire survey of persons involved in real estate transactions. In cases where the date of contract is unknown, the date of registration of the cause in the register is used. These dates are displayed on a quarterly basis (every three months). For example, the transactions conducted in August 2010 are displayed as “3rd quarter 2010” or “2010/07-09”. Transactions for the past one or two years can also be retrieved: The search option in this case is displayed as the “3rd quarter 2010 (including the past one/two years).”"},subtitle26:{subtitle:"　　Renovation",fragment1:"For ",link1:"pre-owned condominiums",fragment2:', the renovation status are provided. The renovation done is displayed as "Done", and the one not renovation is displayed as "Not yet". In cases where the renovation status are unknown, the entry field for the unknown ratio is left blank.'},subtitle27:{subtitle:"　　Transactional factors",fragment:"Transactional factors are provided when there is additional information that may have impact on transaction prices. They are provided only when relevant additional information is obtained via a questionnaire survey."},subtitle28:{subtitle:"　　Land Price Public Notices and Land Price Surveys in Surrounding Area",fragment1:"“View” is displayed when there is any location with ",link1:"land price public notice and/or prefectural land price survey information",fragment2:" for ",link2:"residential land (land only)",fragment3:", ",link3:"residential land (land and building)",fragment4:", ",link4:"agricultural land",fragment5:", or ",link5:"forest land",fragment6:'. Click "View" to show the details of the land price public notice and/or prefectural land price survey information. If there is no such location in the same area, the field is left blank.'},closedPriceDataDescription:"<Description of Contract Price Information Items>",subtitle29:{subtitle:"　　Type",fragment1:"Since the contract price information provided here includes only contracts for detached houses and condominiums, it is shown for residential land (land and building) and pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment2:"Transactions for residential land (land and building) mean the package transactions for the land and buildings, etc..",fragment3:"Transactions for pre-owned condominiums, etc. are the transactions for condominium units (apartments, etc.)."},subtitle30:{subtitle:"　　Location",fragment:"For location, addresses are shown only up to cho (town) and oaza (smaller parts of a town) (e.g., Kasumigaseki, Chiyoda ward; Benten, Minato ward, Osaka, etc.)."},subtitle31:{subtitle:"　　Nearest Station",fragment1:"For the ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the name of the nearest train station and the time distance (minute) from the location of the property to the nearest train station (for subway, to the ground entrance) are displayed.",fragment4:"A time distance less than 30 minutes is displayed in minutes for ",fragment5:" and in increments of 5 minutes for ",fragment6:", with the number rounded up to the nearest 5-minute interval.",fragment7:"A time distance greater than 30 minutes is displayed in the following time periods: 30 minutes to 59 minutes, 1 hour to 1 hour 29 minutes, 1 hour 30 minutes to 1 hour 59 minutes, and 2 hours or more.",fragment8:"For cases where the nearest station is unknown, the entry field is left blank. In cases where the nearest station or time distance (minute) to the nearest train station is unknown, the field is left blank."},subtitle32:{subtitle:"　　Total Transaction Value",fragment1:"For each of the ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the total transaction value (10,000 yen) is displayed (overhead costs, such as agent’s commission, not included). ",fragment4:"Figures are rounded to two decimal places. Any numerical adjustments other than rounding are not made to the figures."},subtitle33:{subtitle:"　　Area (㎡)",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", the registered area (m2) specified in a register is provided.",fragment3:"For ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", the floor area (m2) of the exclusively owned area registered in a register (the area measured inside walls or other partitions) is provided. In both cases, numbers are rounded up to the nearest 5-square meter unit. In cases where the area is unknown, the field is left blank."},subtitle34:{subtitle:"　　Total Floor Area of Building (㎡)",fragment1:"For buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", the total floor area (㎡) is provided.",fragment3:"For ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment4:", the floor area (m2) of the exclusively owned area registered in a register (the area measured inside walls or other partitions) is provided. In both cases, numbers are rounded up to the nearest 5-square meter unit. In cases where the total floor area is unknown, the field is left blank."},subtitle35:{subtitle:"　　Construction Year of Building",fragment1:"For buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the construction year of each building is provided.",fragment4:"In cases where the construction year is unknown, the entry field is left blank."},subtitle36:{subtitle:"　　Building Structure",fragment1:"For buildings on ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:" and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the structure of each building is provided using the following abbreviations:",fragment4:"In cases where the structure is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm1:"Steel frame reinforced concrete",definitionDescription1:"SRC",descriptionTerm2:"Reinforced concrete",definitionDescription2:"RC",descriptionTerm3:"Steel frame",definitionDescription3:"S",descriptionTerm4:"Light steel structure",definitionDescription4:"LS",descriptionTerm5:"Concrete block",definitionDescription5:"B",descriptionTerm6:"Wooden",definitionDescription6:"W",descriptionTerm7:"Other",definitionDescription7:"O"},subtitle37:{subtitle:"　　Room Layout of Exclusively Owned Area",fragment1:"For ",link1:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment2:", the room layout in the exclusively owned area is provided. In cases where the room layout is unknown, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm:"For example:",definitionDescription:"1K, 1DK, 2DK, 1LDK, 2LDK, 3LDK, 4LDK, etc."},subtitle38:{subtitle:"　　Frontage Road",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", the width (m), type, and direction of the road in contact with the land are provided.",fragment3:"In cases where the frontage road or road type is unknown, the field is left blank.",fragment4:"Road types are displayed as follows:",note1:"For roads specified by the Road Act: Public road",note2:"For privately managed roads that are commonly called private roads: Private road"},subtitle39:{subtitle:"　　City Planning",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the use districts designated by the City Planning Act are represented by the following abbreviations:",fragment4:"In cases where the city plan is unknown, where no specific-use area is designated within a city planning area, and where no area classification is specified in the area, the field is left blank.",descriptionTerm1:"Category I exclusively low-story residential zone",definitionDescription1:"1 Exc Low",descriptionTerm2:"Category II exclusively low-story residential zone",definitionDescription2:"2 Exc Low",descriptionTerm3:"Category I exclusively medium-high residential zone",definitionDescription3:"1 Exc Med",descriptionTerm4:"Category II exclusively medium-high residential zone",definitionDescription4:"2 Exc Med",descriptionTerm5:"Category I residential zone",definitionDescription5:"1 Res",descriptionTerm6:"Category II residential zone",definitionDescription6:"2 Res",descriptionTerm7:"Quasi-residential zone",definitionDescription7:"Quasi-Res",descriptionTerm8:"Rural Residential zone",definitionDescription8:"Rural Res",descriptionTerm9:"Neighborhood commercial zone",definitionDescription9:"Neighborhood Comm",descriptionTerm10:"Commercial zone",definitionDescription10:"Commercial",descriptionTerm11:"Quasi-industrial zone",definitionDescription11:"Quasi-Ind",descriptionTerm12:"Industrial zone",definitionDescription12:"Industrial",descriptionTerm13:"Exclusively industrial zone",definitionDescription13:"Exc Ind"},subtitle40:{subtitle:"　　Maximums Building Coverage Ratio and Maximums Floor-area Ratio (%)",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land and building)",fragment2:", and ",link2:"pre-owned condominiums, etc.",fragment3:", the designated Maximums building coverage ratio (%) and maximums floor-area ratio (%) are provided.",fragment4:"In cases where the maximums building coverage ratio and/or the Maximums floor-area ratio are unknown, the entry field for the unknown ratio is left blank."},subtitle41:{subtitle:"　　Transaction Period",fragment:"The data is displayed on a quarterly (3-month) basis. In cases where the date of contract is unknown, the date of registration of the cause in the register is used. These dates are displayed on a quarterly basis (every three months). For example, the transactions conducted in August 2010 are displayed as “3rd quarter 2010” or “2010/07-09”. Transactions for the past one or two years can also be retrieved: The search option in this case is displayed as the “3rd quarter 2010 (including the past one/two years).”"},subtitle42:{subtitle:"　　Renovation",fragment1:"For ",link1:"pre-owned condominiums",fragment2:', the renovation status are provided. The renovation done is displayed as "Done". In cases where the renovation status are unknown, the entry field for the unknown ratio is left blank.'},analysisDataDescription:"<Description of Analysis Data>",subtitle43:{subtitle:"　　Land Transaction Price Overview",fragment1:"For properties in the ",link1:"residential districts or commercial districts",fragment2:" of the ",link2:"residential land (land only)",fragment3:" in major cities (prefectural capitals, government ordinance cities, and core cities, etc.), the average and median ,etc. of unit land prices per square meter (㎡) are provided in the form of a table and a graph. Click Land Transaction Price Overview on the search result display screen to display the data.",caution:{title:"<Notes>",caution1:{fragment1:"The information provided here has been compiled based on all the ",link:"Real Estate Transaction Price Information",fragment2:" System data available at the time of publication for the areas covered."},caution2:"The number of samples in the compiled quarterly transaction price data is subject to change in the future. Please note that the number of samples for the latest quarter, in particular, may significantly change in the next quarter or later.",caution3:"The compilation of this data does not constitute a statistical survey."}},subtitle44:{subtitle:"　　Changes in the number of transactions",fragment1:"Click Changes in the number of transactions on the search result display screen to display a graph that shows changes in the number of quarterly (three months) transactions. When a search is conducted for ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", ",link2:"residential land (land and building)",fragment3:", ",link3:"agricultural land",fragment4:", or ",link4:"forest land",fragment5:", changes in the number of land transactions will be displayed, Whereas When a search is conducted for pre-owned condominiums, etc., changes in the number of condominium transactions, etc. will be displayed.",fragment6:"When a search for ALL is conducted, changes in the total number of transactions including land and condominium transactions, etc. will be displayed. For details about the number of transactions, please see ",link5:"4 “Number of Transactions",fragment7:".”",caution:{title:"<Notes>",caution:"The compilation of these data does not constitute a statistical survey."}},subtitle45:{subtitle:"　　Scatter Diagram",fragment1:"For ",link1:"residential land (land only)",fragment2:", the following two types of scatter diagrams are provided:",fragment3:"Scatter Diagram: Relations between the unit land price per square meter (㎡) and the width of frontage road",fragment4:"This scatter diagram shows the relations between the ",link2:"unit land price per square meter (㎡)",fragment5:" and the ",link3:"width (m) of the frontage road",fragment6:". Click the Graph button in the Condition of Frontage Road on the search result display screen to show the diagram.",fragment7:"In cases where the frontage road is unknown, the diagram will not be displayed.",fragment8:"Click in the scatter diagram",fragment9:" to show the detailed ",link4:"Real Estate Transaction-price Information",fragment10:" System of the point.",fragment11:"Scatter Diagram: Relationship between the unit land price per square meter (㎡) and the distance to the nearest station",fragment12:"(displayed only when a search by line and station is conducted).",fragment13:"The scatter diagram shows the relations between the ",link5:"time distance (minute) to the nearest station",fragment14:". Click the Graph button (displayed only when a search by line and station is conducted) in the Nearest Station on the search result display screen to show the diagram.",fragment15:"In cases where the nearest station is unknown, the diagram will not be displayed."},operationInstruction:"<Other Notes>",subtitle46:{subtitle:"　　Overall Description",fragment1:"Please read the ",fragment2:" before using this website. By using this website, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you wish to use the API function, also read the ",fragment3:" before submitting your application.",fragment4:"Descriptions of each functions and operational procedures can be displayed by placing a mouse over the “?” mark on each screen.",fragment5:"Click ",fragment6:" for more information about how to use it.",link1:"Terms of Use of the Real Estate Information Library",link2:"Real Estate Information Library API Terms of Use",link3:"here"},subtitle47:{subtitle:"　　Municipal Mergers, etc.",fragment:"The data of this website are based on existing city, town, ward, villages as of July 1,2026."},subtitle48:{subtitle:"　　Version of Browser",fragment1:"It is recommended to view this website using the following devices and web browsers. Web browsers should be the latest versions.",fragment2:"* Recommended version: Windows 10, Windows 11",fragment3:"* Recommended version: iOS16 or later, Android 10 or later",pctitle:"[PC]",pcnote1:"Windows×Google Chrome",pcnote2:"Windows×Microsoft Edge",sptitle:"[Tablet/Smartphone]",spnote1:"iOS×Safari",spnote2:"iOS×